      "schema": "view-scroll-v1",
      "source": "application.ccn 04-Office. Frame header chunk 13108 (world/window). Layers chunk 13121 read as 16.16 FIXED POINT -- a float read returns 0.000 for every layer and looks like a real answer. Instances chunk 13112: 4-byte count then 20-byte records handle/oi/x/y/parentType/parentHandle/layer/unknown, instance OI is raw ^48 then ^28 for build 26. Several hitboxes are REPOSITIONED at StartOfFrame, so a placed coordinate can lie: grep the frame for SetPosition.",
